sequenceDiagram
  participant V as LearningStatisticsView
  participant A as learningRecordsApi
  participant C as LearningRecordController
  participant S as LearningRecordService
  participant R as LearningRecordRepository
  V->>A: load seven-day statistics
  A->>C: GET /learning/statistics
  C->>S: statistics(currentUser, course)
  S->>R: aggregate duration/visits/completions
  R-->>V: trend + recent records
  Note over A,V: 仅同用户同课程缓存；401/403 不回退旧缓存
